<title>SWEDEN: Investor dividend income '97 1.6 bln Skr.</title>
<headline>Investor dividend income '97 1.6 bln Skr.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish investment company Investor AB said on Thurday that 1997 dividend payments received will reach more than 1.6 billion crowns, based on current share holdings.</p>
<p>Investor is the key holding company in the Wallenberg family's financial empire.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
